### Summary

Phase 1 implementation is **largely correct** and follows the spec well. The HomeScreen renders all three sections, Continue Watching has progress bars and one-tap resume, and the router/scaffold were updated with Home as the default route. 8 tests cover the main scenarios. Two issues found.

